#. ja: やあ。ギルドリーヴを受けるかい？
#. de: Seid gegrüßt, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>. Ich bin für das Ausstellen von Freibriefen zuständig.
#. fr: Salut<nbsp>! Tu veux un mandat<nbsp>?
#. column 31: My apologies, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>, but I am not authorized to issue guildleves to those as new to adventuring as you appear to be.
#. column 32: The quest you were assigned is of the utmost import. May the Matron see you to success.
#. column 33: 0
#. column 34: 0
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:1:0:30"
msgid "Greetings, adventurer. I deal in the issuing of guildleves."
msgstr "Приветствую, искатель приключений. Я выдаю гильдейские поручения."

#. ja: 駆け出しの冒険者さんですね。一人前になってからおいで。
#. de: Verzeiht, <if $gn4>meine Dame<else>mein Herr</if>, aber ich bin nicht dazu autorisiert, Freibriefe an Neulinge wie Euch auszustellen.
#. fr: Hum, tu débutes à peine, je me trompe<nbsp>? Reviens quand tu auras un peu plus d'expérience, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. column 30: Greetings, adventurer. I deal in the issuing of guildleves.
#. column 32: The quest you were assigned is of the utmost import. May the Matron see you to success.
#. column 33: 0
#. column 34: 0
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
#. macro: <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:1:0:31"
msgid "My apologies, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>, but I am not authorized to issue guildleves to those as new to adventuring as you appear to be."
msgstr "Прошу прощения, <if $gn4>сударыня<else>сударь</if>, но я не вправе выдавать поручения таким неопытным в приключениях, как вы."

#. ja: ご苦労様です！　任務の成功を祈っています。
#. de: Die Euch zugedachte Aufgabe ist von äußerster Wichtigkeit. Möge die Matrone Euch hold sein.
#. fr: Bon courage<nbsp>! J'espère que tout se passera bien.
#. column 30: Greetings, adventurer. I deal in the issuing of guildleves.
#. column 31: My apologies, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>, but I am not authorized to issue guildleves to those as new to adventuring as you appear to be.
#. column 33: 0
#. column 34: 0
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:1:0:32"
msgid "The quest you were assigned is of the utmost import. May the Matron see you to success."
msgstr "Вам поручено важное дело. Пусть Матрона поможет вам довести его до конца."

#. ja: 予備
#. de: In Vorbereitung
#. fr: Rien.
