#. ja: こちらでギルドリーヴを発行しています。<br>あなたにぴったりのお仕事をお探ししますよ。
#. de: Wenn du auf der Suche nach einem Freibrief bist, habe ich genau das Richtige für dich.
#. fr: Bonjour. Souhaitez-vous obtenir un mandat<nbsp>? Je vais vous aider à trouver un travail qui corresponde à vos aptitudes.
#. column 31: My records show that you have only recently arrived in Eorzea. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 32: Good luck, and may the Twelve be with you.
#. column 33: My records show that you have only recently arrived in the area. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 34: Let me see here... Ah, yes. Our levewatches report that you completed all leve objectives within the allotted time. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Let me ready your reward.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: It addition to the objectives, it also seems you have found the time to slay a wanted target. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! The bounty is yours!
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:2:0:30"
msgid "If it is a guildleve you seek, then I may just have the right one for you."
msgstr "Ищете гильдейское поручение? Кажется, у меня найдётся для вас подходящее."

#. ja: ここでは冒険者ギルドに所属する人たちに、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の仕事を発行しているの。<br><key>あなたが<switch $n1><case>チャ・モクリ<case>ゴントラン<case>ユースタス</switch>さんから<br>リーヴの仕事を受けられるようになったら、<br>働き口を紹介してあげるわ。
#. de: Meinen Auf<shy>zeich<shy>nun<shy>gen entnehme ich, dass du erst kürzlich in Eorzea eingetroffen bist. Es tut mir leid, aber ich kann dir keinen Freibrief anvertrauen, ehe du nicht dein Können unter Beweis gestellt und in der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde <switch $n1><case>Baderons<case>Miounnes<case>Momodis</switch> Erlaubnis bekommen hast.
#. fr: Ici, nous proposons des mandats aux aventuriers rattachés à la guilde. Quand vous aurez assez d'expérience pour <switch $n1><case>que T'mokkri<case>que Gontrant<case>qu'Eustace</switch> vous donne des au<shy>to<shy>ri<shy>sa<shy>tions, alors je vous trouverai du travail.
#. column 30: If it is a guildleve you seek, then I may just have the right one for you.
#. column 32: Good luck, and may the Twelve be with you.
#. column 33: My records show that you have only recently arrived in the area. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 34: Let me see here... Ah, yes. Our levewatches report that you completed all leve objectives within the allotted time. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Let me ready your reward.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: It addition to the objectives, it also seems you have found the time to slay a wanted target. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! The bounty is yours!
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:2:0:31"
msgid "My records show that you have only recently arrived in Eorzea. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild."
msgstr "По моим записям, вы совсем недавно прибыли в Эорзею. Простите, но я не могу доверить вам поручение, пока вы не докажете свои способности хотя бы <switch $n1><case>Бадерону<case>Матери Миунне<case>Момоди</switch> из гильдии искателей приключений."

#. ja: さあ、リーヴの任務は任せましたよ。
#. de: Viel Glück, und mögen die Gebieter mit dir sein.
#. fr: Tout est en règle, vous pouvez y aller. J'espère que la chance vous sourira.
#. column 30: If it is a guildleve you seek, then I may just have the right one for you.
#. column 31: My records show that you have only recently arrived in Eorzea. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 33: My records show that you have only recently arrived in the area. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 34: Let me see here... Ah, yes. Our levewatches report that you completed all leve objectives within the allotted time. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Let me ready your reward.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: It addition to the objectives, it also seems you have found the time to slay a wanted target. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! The bounty is yours!
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:2:0:32"
msgid "Good luck, and may the Twelve be with you."
msgstr "Удачи вам! Пусть Двенадцать будут с вами."

#. ja: ここでは冒険者ギルドに所属する人たちに、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の仕事を発行しているの。<br><key>あなたが<switch $n1><case>チャ・モクリ<case>ゴントラン<case>ユースタス</switch>さんから<br>リーヴの仕事を受けられるようになったら、<br>働き口を紹介してあげるわ。
