msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:2:0:33"
msgid "My records show that you have only recently arrived in the area. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild."
msgstr "По моим записям, вы совсем недавно прибыли в эти края. Простите, но я не могу доверить вам поручение, пока вы не докажете свои способности хотя бы <switch $n1><case>Бадерону<case>Матери Миунне<case>Момоди</switch> из гильдии искателей приключений."

#. ja: 無事に任務を達成されたようですね。<br>あなたにお仕事をお任せしたのは、正解だったようです。<br>さぁ、遠慮なさらず、こちらの報酬を受け取って下さい。
#. de: Lass mich mal nachsehen ... Aha. Unsere Beobachter bestätigen, dass du alle Ziele des Freibriefes innerhalb der erlaubten Zeit erledigt hast. Gut gemacht, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Hier ist deine Belohnung.
#. fr: Vous avez terminé le travail sans encombres, à ce que je vois. J'ai bien fait de vous confier cette mission. Tenez, prenez votre récompense.
#. column 30: If it is a guildleve you seek, then I may just have the right one for you.
#. column 31: My records show that you have only recently arrived in Eorzea. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 32: Good luck, and may the Twelve be with you.
#. column 33: My records show that you have only recently arrived in the area. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: It addition to the objectives, it also seems you have found the time to slay a wanted target. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! The bounty is yours!
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:2:0:34"
msgid "Let me see here... Ah, yes. Our levewatches report that you completed all leve objectives within the allotted time. Well done, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Let me ready your reward."
msgstr "Так, посмотрим... Ага! Наблюдатели докладывают, что вы выполнили все задания поручения в срок. Отличная работа, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Сейчас приготовлю вам награду."

#. ja: あなたが、賞金首を仕留めたですって？<br>これは驚いたわね……<br>えぇ、もちろん報酬は上乗せさせてもらうわ。
#. de: Und außerdem hast du noch die Zeit gefunden, ein gesuchtes Ziel zu erledigen. Bravo, hier ist das Kopfgeld.
#. fr: Vous avez abattu une créature dont la tête était mise à prix, vous dites<nbsp>!? Eh bien, ça alors... Bien sûr, cela mérite une récompense sup<shy>plé<shy>men<shy>tai<shy>re. Voilà<nbsp>!
#. column 30: If it is a guildleve you seek, then I may just have the right one for you.
#. column 31: My records show that you have only recently arrived in Eorzea. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 32: Good luck, and may the Twelve be with you.
#. column 33: My records show that you have only recently arrived in the area. I am sorry, but I cannot entrust you with the responsibility of a levequest until you have proven yourself to at least <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 34: Let me see here... Ah, yes. Our levewatches report that you completed all leve objectives within the allotted time. Well done, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Let me ready your reward.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:2:0:37"
msgid "It addition to the objectives, it also seems you have found the time to slay a wanted target. Well done, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! The bounty is yours!"
msgstr "Похоже, помимо поручения вы успели расправиться с разыскиваемым преступником. Отличная работа, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Вот ваша награда за его голову!"

#. ja: 近隣の住民たちから寄せられた依頼を、<br>ギルドリーヴとして発行しております。
#. de: Die Bürger Gridanias brauchen dich, <if $gn4>meine Freundin<else>mein Freund</if>. Es gibt Einiges zu tun, falls du Interesse hast.
#. fr: Bonjour, nous émettons des mandats destinés aux aventuriers en fonction des tâches que l'on nous confie.
#. column 31: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, certain formalities must be observed. Namely, <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild must vouch for your abilities.
#. column 32: May the Spinner smile upon your endeavor.
#. column 33: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, you appear unready to confront the fell beasts we have lurking in these woods. It is for your own well-being that I must deny you work.
#. column 34: So you have returned triumphant! Come, your reward awaits.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Watches tell me ye went and stuck ye a wanted target, to boot. I suppose ye'll be wantin' the bounty with yer reward, then, eh?
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:3:0:30"
msgid "You wish to undertake leves? Then you have come to the right place."
msgstr "Хотите взяться за поручение? Тогда вы пришли по адресу."

#. ja: お仕事をお探しですか？<br>ここでは実力ある冒険者の方に<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の仕事を発行しておりますの。<br>まずはギルドの世話役である<br><switch $n1><case>バデロン<case>ミューヌ<case>モモディ</switch>さんからの紹介があれば、<br>その時はお仕事を斡旋させていただきますわ。
#. de: Ich habe keine Arbeit für dich, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>. Verfeinere deine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten und besuche mich später wieder. <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> kann dir sicherlich dabei helfen.
#. fr: Vous cherchez du travail<nbsp>? Ici, nous proposons des mandats aux aventuriers rattachés à la guilde. Quand <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> vous recommandera, je vous trouverai du travail.
#. column 30: You wish to undertake leves? Then you have come to the right place.
#. column 32: May the Spinner smile upon your endeavor.
#. column 33: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, you appear unready to confront the fell beasts we have lurking in these woods. It is for your own well-being that I must deny you work.
#. column 34: So you have returned triumphant! Come, your reward awaits.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Watches tell me ye went and stuck ye a wanted target, to boot. I suppose ye'll be wantin' the bounty with yer reward, then, eh?
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:3:0:31"
msgid "You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, certain formalities must be observed. Namely, <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild must vouch for your abilities."
msgstr "Хотите взяться за поручение? Пылу вам не занимать, но сперва нужно соблюсти некоторые формальности. А именно: <switch $n1><case>Бадерон<case>Мать Миунне<case>Момоди</switch> из гильдии искателей приключений должна поручиться за ваши способности."

#. ja: 任務の成功をお祈りしております。
#. de: Ich hoffe, du kommst unversehrt von deiner Aufgabe zurück.
#. fr: Et voilà<nbsp>! Je vous souhaite bonne chance, à présent.
#. column 30: You wish to undertake leves? Then you have come to the right place.
#. column 31: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, certain formalities must be observed. Namely, <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild must vouch for your abilities.
#. column 33: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, you appear unready to confront the fell beasts we have lurking in these woods. It is for your own well-being that I must deny you work.
#. column 34: So you have returned triumphant! Come, your reward awaits.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Watches tell me ye went and stuck ye a wanted target, to boot. I suppose ye'll be wantin' the bounty with yer reward, then, eh?
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:3:0:32"
msgid "May the Spinner smile upon your endeavor."
msgstr "Пусть Прядильщица благоволит вашему начинанию."

#. ja: お仕事をお探しですか？<br>ここでは実力ある冒険者の方に<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の仕事を発行しておりますの。<br>あなたが、この辺りの魔物に<br>引けを取らぬ実力を身につけたとき、<br>改めてお仕事を斡旋させていただきますわ。
#. de: Ich habe keine Arbeit für dich, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>. Verfeinere deine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten und besuche mich später wieder, wenn du bewiesen hast, dass du es mit den Kreaturen in dieser Gegend aufnehmen kannst.
#. fr: Vous cherchez du travail<nbsp>? Ici, nous proposons des mandats aux aventuriers rattachés à la guilde. Quand vous aurez suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment progressé pour vaincre les monstres du coin, je vous trouverai du travail.
#. column 30: You wish to undertake leves? Then you have come to the right place.
#. column 31: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, certain formalities must be observed. Namely, <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild must vouch for your abilities.
#. column 32: May the Spinner smile upon your endeavor.
#. column 34: So you have returned triumphant! Come, your reward awaits.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Watches tell me ye went and stuck ye a wanted target, to boot. I suppose ye'll be wantin' the bounty with yer reward, then, eh?
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:3:0:33"
msgid "You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, you appear unready to confront the fell beasts we have lurking in these woods. It is for your own well-being that I must deny you work."
msgstr "Хотите взяться за поручение? Пылу вам не занимать, но вы пока не справитесь с опасными тварями, что водятся в этих лесах. Не могу подвергать вас такой опасности."

#. ja: ギルドリーヴ達成の報告ですね？<br>お疲れ様でした、約束の報酬はこちらです……。<br>これで依頼主も満足されることでしょう。
#. de: Deine Leistung wurde von den örtlichen Beobachtern anerkannt. Diese Belohnung hast du dir reichlich verdient.
#. fr: Vous venez rendre compte de votre mission, très bien. Voici votre récompense... Le client sera satisfait, c'est certain<nbsp>!
#. column 30: You wish to undertake leves? Then you have come to the right place.
#. column 31: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, certain formalities must be observed. Namely, <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild must vouch for your abilities.
#. column 32: May the Spinner smile upon your endeavor.
#. column 33: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, you appear unready to confront the fell beasts we have lurking in these woods. It is for your own well-being that I must deny you work.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Watches tell me ye went and stuck ye a wanted target, to boot. I suppose ye'll be wantin' the bounty with yer reward, then, eh?
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:3:0:34"
msgid "So you have returned triumphant! Come, your reward awaits."
msgstr "Вернулись с победой! Ваша награда уже ждёт вас."

#. ja: あら、賞金首を倒してくださったのですか？<br>それでは報酬を上乗せさせていただきますわ。
#. de: Genauso wie das Kopfgeld für das gesuchte Ziel, das du nebenbei noch ausgeschaltet hast. Gute Arbeit!
#. fr: Vous avez abattu une créature dont la tête était mise à prix, vous dites<nbsp>? Mes félicitations<nbsp>! Tenez, voici la prime promise. En espérant que vous en ferez bon usage.
#. column 30: You wish to undertake leves? Then you have come to the right place.
#. column 31: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, certain formalities must be observed. Namely, <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild must vouch for your abilities.
#. column 32: May the Spinner smile upon your endeavor.
#. column 33: You wish to undertake leves? While your enthusiasm cannot be denied, you appear unready to confront the fell beasts we have lurking in these woods. It is for your own well-being that I must deny you work.
#. column 34: So you have returned triumphant! Come, your reward awaits.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:3:0:37"
msgid "Watches tell me ye went and stuck ye a wanted target, to boot. I suppose ye'll be wantin' the bounty with yer reward, then, eh?"
msgstr "Наблюдатели говорят, вы ещё и с разыскиваемой тварью расправились. Ну что, хотите получить награду за её голову вместе с вознаграждением за поручение?"

#. ja: やあ。ギルドリーヴに興味はないかな？<br>いい仕事を斡旋するよ！
#. de: Du scheinst mir geistig und körperlich auf der Höhe zu sein. Hättest du Interesse an einem Freibrief?
#. fr: Salut<nbsp>! Les mandats t'intéressent<nbsp>? Je peux te trouver des boulots in<shy>té<shy>res<shy>sants<nbsp>!
#. column 31: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild has deemed you worthy.
#. column 32: Do not stray from duty, adventurer. I suggest seeing to the tasks at hand immediately.
#. column 33: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once you've proven you can stand your ground against the creatures roaming these parts.
#. column 34: Your performance was noted by the local levewatches. I shall prepare your reward accordingly.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: And do not fret. The bounty for the wanted creature you slew has been added.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:4:0:30"
msgid "There is work to be had, if you are interested, my friend."
msgstr "Если вам нужна работа, у меня найдётся кое-что интересное, друг мой."

#. ja: 僕は冒険者ギルドの一員だよ。<br>相応の実力がある冒険者に対して、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の仕事を発行しているんだ。<br>君が世話役の<switch $n1><case>バデロン<case>ミューヌ<case>モモディ</switch>さんに<br>認められるほどの腕前になったら、<br>その時は、いい仕事を斡旋してあげるよ！
#. de: Ich spüre eine gewisse Schwäche in deinem Körper und Geist. In diesem Zustand kann ich dir leider keinen Freibrief zuweisen. Vielleicht hat <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> eine Aufgabe, an der du wachsen kannst.
#. fr: Je fais partie de la guilde des aventuriers, et je propose des mandats aux membres qui sont assez forts. Quand tu auras la re<shy>com<shy>man<shy>da<shy>tion de <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch>, je te trouverai quelque chose.
#. column 30: There is work to be had, if you are interested, my friend.
#. column 32: Do not stray from duty, adventurer. I suggest seeing to the tasks at hand immediately.
#. column 33: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once you've proven you can stand your ground against the creatures roaming these parts.
#. column 34: Your performance was noted by the local levewatches. I shall prepare your reward accordingly.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: And do not fret. The bounty for the wanted creature you slew has been added.
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:4:0:31"
msgid "I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild has deemed you worthy."
msgstr "Пока для вас у меня работы нет. Поднаторейте и возвращайтесь, когда <switch $n1><case>Бадерон<case>Мать Миунне<case>Момоди</switch> из гильдии искателей приключений сочтёт вас достойным поручения."

#. ja: 上手くやってくれよな。帰りを待っているよ。
#. de: Die Gebieter sind stets wachsam, <if $gn4>meine Freundin<else>mein Freund</if>. Beweis ihnen, dass du der dir zugedachten Pflichten würdig bist.
#. fr: Bon courage. J'attendrai ton retour<nbsp>!
#. column 30: There is work to be had, if you are interested, my friend.
#. column 31: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild has deemed you worthy.
#. column 33: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once you've proven you can stand your ground against the creatures roaming these parts.
#. column 34: Your performance was noted by the local levewatches. I shall prepare your reward accordingly.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: And do not fret. The bounty for the wanted creature you slew has been added.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:4:0:32"
msgid "Do not stray from duty, adventurer. I suggest seeing to the tasks at hand immediately."
msgstr "Не отвлекайтесь от дела, искатель приключений. Советую немедленно заняться порученной работой."

#. ja: 僕は冒険者ギルドの一員だよ。<br>相応の実力がある冒険者に対して、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の仕事を発行しているんだ。<br>この辺りの魔物を退治できるくらい強くなったら、<br>その時は、いい仕事を斡旋してあげるよ！
#. de: Ich spüre eine gewisse Schwäche in deinem Körper und Geist. In diesem Zustand kann ich dir leider keinen Freibrief zuweisen. Du siehst aus, als würdest du vor einem Baumhörnchen Reißaus nehmen. So kann ich dich nicht auf die Bestien in diesen Wäldern loslassen.
#. fr: Je fais partie de la guilde des aventuriers, et je propose des mandats aux membres qui sont assez forts. Quand tu auras suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment progressé pour vaincre les monstres du coin, je te trouverai quelque chose.
#. column 30: There is work to be had, if you are interested, my friend.
#. column 31: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild has deemed you worthy.
#. column 32: Do not stray from duty, adventurer. I suggest seeing to the tasks at hand immediately.
#. column 34: Your performance was noted by the local levewatches. I shall prepare your reward accordingly.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: And do not fret. The bounty for the wanted creature you slew has been added.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:4:0:33"
msgid "I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once you've proven you can stand your ground against the creatures roaming these parts."
msgstr "Пока для вас у меня работы нет. Поднаторейте и возвращайтесь, когда докажете, что способны противостоять тварям, которые водятся в этих краях."

#. ja: やあ、もう戻ったのかい？<br>いやあ、しっかり任務をこなしてくれて助かったよ。<br>また都合のいいときに、よろしく頼むね。
#. de: Du bist bereits zurück? Nun, dann willst du bestimmt deine Belohnung einfordern.
#. fr: Ah, tu as déjà fini<nbsp>? Très bien, très bien, n'hésite pas à revenir quand tu auras du temps libre<nbsp>!
#. column 30: There is work to be had, if you are interested, my friend.
#. column 31: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild has deemed you worthy.
#. column 32: Do not stray from duty, adventurer. I suggest seeing to the tasks at hand immediately.
#. column 33: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once you've proven you can stand your ground against the creatures roaming these parts.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: And do not fret. The bounty for the wanted creature you slew has been added.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:4:0:34"
msgid "Your performance was noted by the local levewatches. I shall prepare your reward accordingly."
msgstr "Наблюдатели отметили, как вы справились с заданием. Сейчас приготовлю вам награду."

#. ja: なんだって、手配中の賞金首を？<br>それはお手柄だったね。<br>もちろん報酬は上乗せさせてもらうよ。
#. de: Keine Sorge. An die Belohnung für die gesuchte Kreatur, die du erschlagen hast, habe ich auch gedacht.
#. fr: Quoi<nbsp>!? Tu as abattu un monstre dont la tête était mise à prix, tu dis<nbsp>? Mais c'est formidable<nbsp>! Tiens, tu as bien mérité ta récompense<nbsp>!
#. column 30: There is work to be had, if you are interested, my friend.
#. column 31: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> of the Adventurers' Guild has deemed you worthy.
#. column 32: Do not stray from duty, adventurer. I suggest seeing to the tasks at hand immediately.
#. column 33: I have no work for you, adventurer. Hone your skills, and then come and see me again once you've proven you can stand your ground against the creatures roaming these parts.
#. column 34: Your performance was noted by the local levewatches. I shall prepare your reward accordingly.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:4:0:37"
msgid "And do not fret. The bounty for the wanted creature you slew has been added."
msgstr "Не волнуйтесь: я добавил к награде и деньги за голову разыскиваемой твари, которую вы убили."

#. ja: 黒衣森の各地から依頼された様々な仕事、<br>ギルドリーヴを発行しています。
#. de: Die Bewohner des Waldes der Einkehr benötigen deine Hilfe, <if $gn4>Abenteurerin<else>Abenteurer</if>.
#. fr: Bonjour, nous émettons des mandats destinés aux aventuriers en fonction des tâches qui nous parviennent des quatre coins de la forêt.
#. column 31: The people of the Twelveswood are always looking for those willing to assist them. Unfortunately, you still look a tad green to be of any real help. Now if <switch $n1><case>someone such as Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>someone such as Momodi Modi</switch> were to vouch for you, that would be a different story...
#. column 32: The quest you were assigned is of the utmost import. May the Matron see you to success.
#. column 33: The people of the Twelveswood are always looking for those willing to assist them. Unfortunately, you still look a tad green to be of any real help. Now if <switch $n1><case>someone such as Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>someone such as Momodi Modi</switch> were to vouch for you, that would be a different story...
#. column 34: Well done, adventurer. The levewatch overseeing your duty was thoroughly impressed. You may take your reward.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Oh, and I have seen to it that the bounty of the wanted target you most bravely slew was included.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:5:0:30"
msgid "The people of the Twelveswood need your help, adventurer. Have you the courage to provide it?"
msgstr "Жителям Леса Двенадцати нужна ваша помощь, искатель приключений. Хватит ли у вас смелости прийти им на выручку?"

#. ja: ここは冒険者に仕事を斡旋する<br>「ギルドリーヴ」発行カウンターです。<br><key>新米冒険者さんのようですね。<br><switch $n1><case>バデロン<case>ミューヌ<case>モモディ</switch>さんからの紹介があれば、<br>喜んで任務を回しますよ。
#. de: Die Bewohner des Waldes der Einkehr sind immer auf der Suche nach willigen Helfern. Leider scheinst du mir noch ein wenig zu grün hinter den Ohren zu sein. Frage mal <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch>, <switch $n1><case>er<case>sie<case>sie</switch> hat sicher etwas Passendes für dich.
#. fr: Vous êtes au guichet des mandats, où nous proposons aux aventuriers des tâches adaptées à leur capacités. Si <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> vous recommande, je vous donnerai du travail avec joie.
#. column 30: The people of the Twelveswood need your help, adventurer. Have you the courage to provide it?
#. column 32: The quest you were assigned is of the utmost import. May the Matron see you to success.
#. column 33: The people of the Twelveswood are always looking for those willing to assist them. Unfortunately, you still look a tad green to be of any real help. Now if <switch $n1><case>someone such as Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>someone such as Momodi Modi</switch> were to vouch for you, that would be a different story...
#. column 34: Well done, adventurer. The levewatch overseeing your duty was thoroughly impressed. You may take your reward.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Oh, and I have seen to it that the bounty of the wanted target you most bravely slew was included.
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>someone such as Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>someone such as Momodi Modi</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:5:0:31"
msgid "The people of the Twelveswood are always looking for those willing to assist them. Unfortunately, you still look a tad green to be of any real help. Now if <switch $n1><case>someone such as Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>someone such as Momodi Modi</switch> were to vouch for you, that would be a different story..."
msgstr "Жители Леса Двенадцати всегда рады тем, кто готов им помочь. Жаль только, что вы пока зелёный новичок и толку от вас будет немного. Вот если бы за вас поручился кто-нибудь вроде <switch $n1><case>Бадерона Десятипалого<case>Матери Миунне<case>Момоди Моди</switch>, тогда другое дело..."

#. ja: 0
#. de: Die Euch zugedachte Aufgabe ist von äußerster Wichtigkeit. Möge die Matrone Euch hold sein.
#. fr: Bon courage. J'attendrai votre retour<nbsp>!
#. column 30: The people of the Twelveswood need your help, adventurer. Have you the courage to provide it?
#. column 31: The people of the Twelveswood are always looking for those willing to assist them. Unfortunately, you still look a tad green to be of any real help. Now if <switch $n1><case>someone such as Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>someone such as Momodi Modi</switch> were to vouch for you, that would be a different story...
#. column 33: The people of the Twelveswood are always looking for those willing to assist them. Unfortunately, you still look a tad green to be of any real help. Now if <switch $n1><case>someone such as Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>someone such as Momodi Modi</switch> were to vouch for you, that would be a different story...
#. column 34: Well done, adventurer. The levewatch overseeing your duty was thoroughly impressed. You may take your reward.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Oh, and I have seen to it that the bounty of the wanted target you most bravely slew was included.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:5:0:32"
msgid "The quest you were assigned is of the utmost import. May the Matron see you to success."
msgstr "Вам поручено важное дело. Пусть Матрона поможет вам довести его до конца."

#. ja: ここは冒険者に仕事を斡旋する<br>「ギルドリーヴ」発行カウンターです。<br><key>新米冒険者さんのようですね。<br><switch $n1><case>バデロン<case>ミューヌ<case>モモディ</switch>さんからの紹介があれば、<br>喜んで任務を回しますよ。
#. de: Die Bewohner des Waldes der Einkehr sind immer auf der Suche nach willigen Helfern. Leider scheinst du mir noch ein wenig zu grün hinter den Ohren zu sein. Frage mal <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch>, <switch $n1><case>er<case>sie<case>sie</switch> hat sicher etwas Passendes für dich.
