#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Limsa<case>Gridania<case>Ul'dah</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:9:0:31"
msgid "Good <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> to you, adventurer. And a fine <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> it is, I say. A fine <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> to march back to the Adventurers' Guild in <switch $n1><case>Limsa<case>Gridania<case>Ul'dah</switch> and set yourself straight with <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>. Only then will I let you partake in some of these fine guildleves I hold here."
msgstr "Добрый <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>вечер<else>день</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>день<else>вечер</if></if>, искатель приключений. И правда, славный <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>вечер<else>день</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>день<else>вечер</if></if>, скажу я вам. Самое время отправиться в гильдию искателей приключений в <switch $n1><case>Лимсе<case>Гридании<case>Уль'де</switch> и уладить всё с <switch $n1><case>Бадероном Десятипалым<case>Матерью Миунне<case>Момоди Моди</switch>. Только тогда я позволю вам взяться за одно из моих замечательных поручений."

#. ja: それでは、いってらっしゃい。<br>くれぐれも気をつけてくださいね。
#. de: Na dann mal los mit dir! Zeit ist Geld!
#. fr: Allez-y, le temps presse<nbsp>!
#. column 30: Good <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> to you, adventurer. And a fine <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> it is, I say. A fine <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> for a levequest!
#. column 31: Good <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> to you, adventurer. And a fine <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> it is, I say. A fine <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morning</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> to march back to the Adventurers' Guild in <switch $n1><case>Limsa<case>Gridania<case>Ul'dah</switch> and set yourself straight with <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>. Only then will I let you partake in some of these fine guildleves I hold here.
