msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:9:0:37"
msgid "Oh, and the bounty! It almost slipped my mind. I believe you'll be wanting this, as well. Unless, that is, you don't, because I would be more than happy to─ You <i>do</i> want it, then. Alright. I suppose that's only fair, considering <i>you</i> were the one who killed the fiend."
msgstr "Ах да, награда за голову! Чуть не забыл. Думаю, вы и её захотите получить. Хотя если не захотите, я буду только рад оставить её себе... Вы <i>хотите</i>? Ну ладно. Справедливо: ведь это <i>вы</i> убили тварь."

#. ja: 周辺の住人から寄せられた、<br>冒険者ギルドへの依頼をギルドリーヴとして発行しています。
#. de: Die Tölpelturm-Siedlung kann manchmal etwas einsam sein. Aber Arbeit gibt es hier genug.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>. Je suis Swygskyf, de la guilde des aventuriers. Je me charge des mandats du Martinet, le hameau le plus triste d'Éorzéa...
#. column 31: A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done...just not by the likes of an unbloodied fry like yerself. Till <switch $n1><case>ol' Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>wee Momodi Modi</switch> hasn't signed off on ye, I'll entrust the safety of this godsforsaken corner of the realm to more capable hands.
#. column 32: I've me eye on ye and all, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>. See the job's done right, like.
#. column 33: A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done...just not by the likes of an unbloodied fry like yerself. Till ye've shown ye can hold yer own, I'll entrust the safety of this godsforsaken corner of the realm to more capable hands.
#. column 34: A fair lick, that were. Let me ready yer coin now, so as ye can be on yer way.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Ah, but not afore ye take this bounty. I saw what ye did up there to the wanted cur, like. Not fleyed, were ye?
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:10:0:30"
msgid "A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done."
msgstr "В Свифтперче одиноко. Но это не значит, что тут нет работы."

#. ja: 実力ある冒険者の方に向けて、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の仕事を発行しています。<br>ひと稼ぎしたいという方には、うってつけですよ。<br>まずは<switch $n1><case>チャ・モクリさん<case>ゴントランさん<case>ユースタスさん</switch>から、<br>リーヴを受けられるくらいの信用を得てください。<br>そうすれば、あなたに仕事を回して差し上げますよ。
#. de: Die Tölpelturm-Siedlung kann manchmal etwas einsam sein. Aber Arbeit gibt es hier genug ... Nur nicht für so blutige Anfänger wie dich! Kehre zurück und lass dich noch ein bisschen von <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> verhätscheln. Wir sehen uns später wieder.
#. fr: Le Martinet est une colonie qui a été créée après les tragiques événements d'il y a cinq ans. Comme tu peux le remarquer, nous avons beaucoup de choses à faire ici, et ton aide sera donc très appréciée. Mais avant ça, tu vas devoir obtenir une permission auprès <switch $n1><case>de T'mokkri<case>de Gontrant<case>d'Eustace</switch>. Avec les créatures qui rôdent autour du hameau, nous préfèrons éviter de faire travailler les aventuriers novices.
#. column 30: A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done.
#. column 32: I've me eye on ye and all, <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if>. See the job's done right, like.
#. column 33: A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done...just not by the likes of an unbloodied fry like yerself. Till ye've shown ye can hold yer own, I'll entrust the safety of this godsforsaken corner of the realm to more capable hands.
#. column 34: A fair lick, that were. Let me ready yer coin now, so as ye can be on yer way.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Ah, but not afore ye take this bounty. I saw what ye did up there to the wanted cur, like. Not fleyed, were ye?
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>ol' Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>wee Momodi Modi</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:10:0:31"
msgid "A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done...just not by the likes of an unbloodied fry like yerself. Till <switch $n1><case>ol' Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>wee Momodi Modi</switch> hasn't signed off on ye, I'll entrust the safety of this godsforsaken corner of the realm to more capable hands."
msgstr "В Свифтперче одиноко. Но работа тут есть... только не для таких неоперившихся новичков, как вы. Пока <switch $n1><case>старый Бадерон Десятипалый<case>Мать Миунне<case>малая Момоди Моди</switch> за вас не поручится, я доверю безопасность этого богами забытого уголка края более опытным людям."

#. ja: いってらっしゃい。<br>土産話を楽しみにしていますね。
#. de: Ich behalt dich im Auge! Damit du auch keinen Mist baust!
#. fr: Bon courage<nbsp>! Et que Llymlaen veille sur toi.
#. column 30: A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done.
#. column 31: A lonely place, this Swiftperch. That don't mean there ain't work to be done...just not by the likes of an unbloodied fry like yerself. Till <switch $n1><case>ol' Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>wee Momodi Modi</switch> hasn't signed off on ye, I'll entrust the safety of this godsforsaken corner of the realm to more capable hands.
