#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:16:0:37"
msgid "Why, who other than an adventurer would have been able to slay a wanted target <i>in addition</i> to completing <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> levequest duties? The bounty is yours!"
msgstr "Кто, как не искатель приключений, сумел бы <i>вдобавок</i> к поручению расправиться с разыскиваемой целью? Награда за её голову ваша!"

#. ja: あなたも冒険者として、実力を付けてきた様子ですね。<br>その腕っ節に見合う「ギルドリーヴ」がありますよ。<br>ぜひ見ていってください。
#. de: Ah, endlich kommt mal <if $gn4>eine erfahren aussehende Abenteurerin<else>ein erfahren aussehender Abenteurer</if>. Ich bin sicher, ich habe da genau die richtige Beschäftigung für dich.
#. fr: Vous avez l'air de quelqu'un qui a vu des aventures. Que diriez-vous d'accomplir quelques mandats de guilde<nbsp>?
#. column 31: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those who have proven themselves to guildmaster <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>...which you have not.
#. column 32: Make your preparations quickly and proceed with the task at hand. Your clients will be awaiting word of your success.
#. column 33: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those with the capacity to face the creatures of Tranquil Paths and return with their lives...which you do not seem to possess.
#. column 34: Your work today is commendable. I shall see you recompensed at once.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Indeed, you have gone above and beyond the call of duty, what with slaying that wanted dastard. Here, the bounty is yours to take.
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:17:0:30"
msgid "You have the air of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who has seen <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> share of adventure. If you are interested, I may have the perfect job for you."
msgstr "По вам видно, что вы <if $gn4>женщина, повидавшая<else>мужчина, повидавший</if> немало приключений. Если вам интересно, у меня найдётся идеальная работа."

#. ja: わたくしはメルトゥラン。<br>冒険者ギルドの一員として、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の発行を担当しております。<br>しかし、あなたは未だ経験不足の様子……。<br>世話役の<switch $n1><case>バデロン<case>ミューヌ<case>モモディ</switch>さんに、一目置かれるくらい<br>経験を積んでから、またお越しください。
#. de: Ich bin Merthelin von der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde. Bei mir bekommt jeder Freibriefe, dem <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> die Erlaubnis erteilt hat. Von dir ... hat <switch $n1><case>er<case>sie<case>sie</switch> aber nichts gesagt.
#. fr: Je suis Merthelin de la guilde des aventuriers. Je suis chargé de proposer des mandats à ceux qui ont prouvé leur valeur à <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch>... ce que vous n'avez pas encore fait.
#. column 30: You have the air of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who has seen <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> share of adventure. If you are interested, I may have the perfect job for you.
#. column 32: Make your preparations quickly and proceed with the task at hand. Your clients will be awaiting word of your success.
#. column 33: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those with the capacity to face the creatures of Tranquil Paths and return with their lives...which you do not seem to possess.
#. column 34: Your work today is commendable. I shall see you recompensed at once.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Indeed, you have gone above and beyond the call of duty, what with slaying that wanted dastard. Here, the bounty is yours to take.
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:17:0:31"
msgid "I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those who have proven themselves to guildmaster <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>...which you have not."
msgstr "Я Мертелин из гильдии искателей приключений. Я выдаю поручения тем, кто доказал свои способности главе гильдии — <switch $n1><case>Бадерону Десятипалому<case>Матери Миунне<case>Момоди Моди</switch>... а вы ещё не доказали."

#. ja: 準備が整いましたら、ギルドリーヴを開始してください。<br>依頼の遂行、よろしくお願いいたします。
#. de: Wenn du bereit bist, kannst du den Freibrief beginnen.
#. fr: Préparez-vous rapidement et accomplissez la tâche. Le client attend la nouvelle de votre succès avec impatience.
#. column 30: You have the air of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who has seen <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> share of adventure. If you are interested, I may have the perfect job for you.
#. column 31: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those who have proven themselves to guildmaster <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>...which you have not.
#. column 33: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those with the capacity to face the creatures of Tranquil Paths and return with their lives...which you do not seem to possess.
#. column 34: Your work today is commendable. I shall see you recompensed at once.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Indeed, you have gone above and beyond the call of duty, what with slaying that wanted dastard. Here, the bounty is yours to take.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:17:0:32"
msgid "Make your preparations quickly and proceed with the task at hand. Your clients will be awaiting word of your success."
msgstr "Поскорее подготовьтесь и приступайте к делу. Заказчики будут ждать вестей о вашем успехе."

#. ja: わたくしはメルトゥラン。<br>冒険者ギルドの一員として、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の発行を担当しております。<br>しかし、あなたは未だ経験不足の様子……。<br>この辺りの魔物を倒すことができるほど<br>経験を積んでから、またお越しください。
#. de: Ich bin Merthelin von der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde. Bei mir bekommt jeder Freibriefe, der über ausreichend Erfahrung verfügt, um gegen die Monster da draußen zu bestehen. Das ... scheint bei dir aber leider nicht der Fall zu sein.
#. fr: Je suis Merthelin de la guilde des aventuriers. Je suis chargé de proposer des mandats à ceux capables d'affronter les créatures des environs... ce qui n'est pas votre cas.
#. column 30: You have the air of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who has seen <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> share of adventure. If you are interested, I may have the perfect job for you.
#. column 31: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those who have proven themselves to guildmaster <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>...which you have not.
#. column 32: Make your preparations quickly and proceed with the task at hand. Your clients will be awaiting word of your success.
#. column 34: Your work today is commendable. I shall see you recompensed at once.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Indeed, you have gone above and beyond the call of duty, what with slaying that wanted dastard. Here, the bounty is yours to take.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:17:0:33"
msgid "I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those with the capacity to face the creatures of Tranquil Paths and return with their lives...which you do not seem to possess."
msgstr "Я Мертелин из Гильдии искателей приключений. Я выдаю гильдейские поручения тем, кто способен встретить тварей Тихих троп и вернуться живым... Но вы, похоже, не из таких."

#. ja: あなたの働きぶり、素晴らしいものでした。<br>さあ、報酬をお受け取りください。<br>今後も、その腕っ節を頼りにしておりますよ。
#. de: Das war hervorragende Arbeit! Ich hoffe, ich kann wieder mit dir rechnen.
#. fr: Votre travail aujourd'hui a été excellent. Je vais vous récompenser im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment.
#. column 30: You have the air of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who has seen <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> share of adventure. If you are interested, I may have the perfect job for you.
#. column 31: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those who have proven themselves to guildmaster <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>...which you have not.
#. column 32: Make your preparations quickly and proceed with the task at hand. Your clients will be awaiting word of your success.
#. column 33: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those with the capacity to face the creatures of Tranquil Paths and return with their lives...which you do not seem to possess.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: Indeed, you have gone above and beyond the call of duty, what with slaying that wanted dastard. Here, the bounty is yours to take.
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:17:0:34"
msgid "Your work today is commendable. I shall see you recompensed at once."
msgstr "Вы сегодня отлично потрудились. Сейчас же получите заслуженную награду."

#. ja: まさか任務だけでなく、賞金首も討伐されるとは。<br>あなたの手並みには、感服いたしました。<br>それでは報酬も増やしておきますね。
#. de: Du hast dich wirklich ins Zeug gelegt! Wie du nebenbei auch noch das gesuchte Ziel aufgestöbert und zur Strecke gebracht hast, war einsame Spitze! Dafür gebe ich dir einen schönen Bonus.
#. fr: Votre travail aujourd'hui a été excellent<nbsp>! Non seulement vous avez accompli le mandat comme convenu, mais en plus, vous avez abattu une créature qui avait une prime sur sa tête. Vous méritez une récompense à la hauteur de vos efforts<nbsp>!
#. column 30: You have the air of a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who has seen <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> share of adventure. If you are interested, I may have the perfect job for you.
#. column 31: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those who have proven themselves to guildmaster <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>...which you have not.
#. column 32: Make your preparations quickly and proceed with the task at hand. Your clients will be awaiting word of your success.
#. column 33: I am Merthelin of the Adventurers' Guild. I am tasked with meting out guildleves to those with the capacity to face the creatures of Tranquil Paths and return with their lives...which you do not seem to possess.
#. column 34: Your work today is commendable. I shall see you recompensed at once.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:17:0:37"
msgid "Indeed, you have gone above and beyond the call of duty, what with slaying that wanted dastard. Here, the bounty is yours to take."
msgstr "И правда, вы сделали больше, чем от вас требовалось, да ещё и расправились с разыскиваемым преступником. Вот, забирайте награду за его голову."

#. ja: キャンプ・ブルーフォグ周辺に関連した依頼を、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」として発行するのが僕の役目さ。
#. de: Ja, selbst im Camp Blauer Dunst gibt es Freibriefe. Welchen hättest du denn gerne?
#. fr: Au camp de Brumebleue, le responsable des mandats, c'est moi<nbsp>!
#. column 31: \<sigh> Why anyone would <i>choose</i> to come to a place such as th─ Ah, you there! You look to be a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of action. Might I suggest that before entertaining any grand ideas about saving Bluefog from the fetters of evil that you “act” upon my suggestion of gaining the trust of Adventurers' Guild proprietor <switch $n1><case>Baderon Tenfingers<case>Mother Miounne<case>Momodi Modi</switch>? Then, I might be able to accommodate your whims.
#. column 32: Remember, if you die, you cannot claim your reward! Good luck!
#. column 33: \<sigh> Why anyone would <i>choose</i> to come to a place such as th─ Ah, you there! You look to be a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of action... Though, upon closer inspection, you do not appear to have <i>seen</i> much of the stuff. My leves require those who undertake them to put the “act” in “action.” I cannot offer them to one not even ready to spell “act,” let alone...<i>act</i> act.
#. column 34: The <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of action has returned with another leve under <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> belt! So, then. Are you ready to be <i>richly</i> recompensed for services rendered?
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: And what is this? The levewatch informs me that you have slain a wanted target. Huzzah and hurrah. The bounty is claimed!
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:18:0:30"
msgid "\\<sigh> What did I ever do to deserve this post─ Ah, you there! I recall you as a regular <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of action. Might I interest you in another guildleve?"
msgstr "\\<вздыхает> Чем я заслужил такое назначение─ А, это вы! Помню вас, вечно вы в гуще событий. Не желаете взять ещё одно гильдейское поручение?"

#. ja: キャンプ・ブルーフォグ周辺に関連した依頼を、<br>「ギルドリーヴ」として発行するのが僕の役目さ。<br><br>だけど、まずは冒険者ギルドの顔役、<br><switch $n1><case>バデロン<case>ミューヌ<case>モモディ</switch>さんから紹介を受けてほしいな。<br>信頼できる人に仕事を任せたいからね。
#. de: Ich würde dir gerne einen der Freibriefe anvertrauen, aber ich befürchte, dass <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch> leider etwas dagegen hätte. Bitte geh zu <switch $n1><case>ihm<case>ihr<case>ihr</switch> und besprich die Sache.
#. fr: Tu cherches quelque chose à faire, pas vrai<nbsp>? Désolé, mais je ne peux pas te confier de mandat tant que tu n'as pas obtenu la re<shy>com<shy>man<shy>da<shy>tion de <switch $n1><case>Baderon<case>Miounne<case>Momodi</switch>. C'est du travail sérieux, tu comprends<nbsp>?
#. column 30: \<sigh> What did I ever do to deserve this post─ Ah, you there! I recall you as a regular <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of action. Might I interest you in another guildleve?
#. column 32: Remember, if you die, you cannot claim your reward! Good luck!
#. column 33: \<sigh> Why anyone would <i>choose</i> to come to a place such as th─ Ah, you there! You look to be a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of action... Though, upon closer inspection, you do not appear to have <i>seen</i> much of the stuff. My leves require those who undertake them to put the “act” in “action.” I cannot offer them to one not even ready to spell “act,” let alone...<i>act</i> act.
#. column 34: The <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> of action has returned with another leve under <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> belt! So, then. Are you ready to be <i>richly</i> recompensed for services rendered?
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: And what is this? The levewatch informs me that you have slain a wanted target. Huzzah and hurrah. The bounty is claimed!
