msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:24:0:32"
msgid "May the Navigator guide you, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"
msgstr "Да сопутствует вам мореплаватель, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"

#. ja: 「ギルドリーヴ」の経験がある者がいれば、<br>この任務を任せることができるのだが……。<br>軍令部に、兵を回すように上申せねば！
#. de: Mit Grünschnäbeln kann ich nichts anfangen, aber wer schon mal einen Gilden<shy>frei<shy>brief absolviert hat, kann sich jederzeit bei mir zum Dienst melden.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolé, mais je ne suis pas autorisé à confier des missions aux aventuriers qui n'ont pas encore accompli un seul mandat de guilde.
#. column 30: I am Storm Sergeant First Class Eugene Rivers, charged with the issuing of Grand Company levequests.
#. column 31: I am not authorized to issue quests to those who have yet to prove themselves to the realm. Perhaps you should try your hand at several guildleves from the local Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 32: May the Navigator guide you, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>!
#. column 34: Your contribution has been noted, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>, and your seals prepared.
#. column 35: Someone high up believed that it would be a fine idea to allow members from any Grand Company to accept leves meant for the Maelstrom. I personally do not agree, but I have my orders. They did <i>not</i> mention aught of allowing those adventurers who had yet to pledge their allegiance to even the lowly Order of the Twin Adder, let alone the mighty Maelstrom.
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:24:0:33"
msgid "I am not authorized to issue quests to those who have yet to prove themselves to the realm. Perhaps you should try your hand at several guildleves from the local Adventurers' Guild."
msgstr "Я не вправе выдавать поручения тем, кто ещё не доказал свою преданность державе. Попробуйте выполнить несколько гильдейских поручений в местной Гильдии искателей приключений."

#. ja: 任務達成を確認！<br><string $gs1><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>には、<br>規定に従い、軍票を支給する！
#. de: Hast du deinen Auftrag erfolgreich ausgeführt, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>? Hervorragend. Du bist ein Vorbild für alle, die im Dienst des Mahlstroms stehen.
#. fr: Bravo, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>, vous avez fait du bon boulot<nbsp>! Voici vos sceaux, comme convenu.
