msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:24:0:35"
msgid "Someone high up believed that it would be a fine idea to allow members from any Grand Company to accept leves meant for the Maelstrom. I personally do not agree, but I have my orders. They did <i>not</i> mention aught of allowing those adventurers who had yet to pledge their allegiance to even the lowly Order of the Twin Adder, let alone the mighty Maelstrom."
msgstr "Кто-то из начальства решил, что будет славно разрешить членам любой Великой компании брать поручения Водоворота. Я с этим <i>не</i> согласен, но приказ есть приказ. Вот только ни слова не было о том, чтобы выдавать их тем, кто даже в скромный Орден Двух Змей не вступил, не говоря уж о могучем Водовороте."

#. ja: 自分は、黒渦団に所属するカ・ラフミン甲曹長。<br>「グランドカンパニーリーヴ」の発行を担当しています。
#. de: Ahoi! Ich bin Sturmmaat 1. Klasse C'lafumyn, stets dem Mahlstrom zu Diensten. Nur keine Müdigkeit vorschützen, versuch dich an einem Staatserlass!
#. fr: Mon nom est C'lafumyn. Je suis chargée de distribuer des mandats de grrrande compagnie pour le Maelstrom.
#. column 31: I will not issue Grand Company levequests to those who have not even completed a single leve for the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 32: May the Navigator guide you, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>!
#. column 33: I will not issue Grand Company levequests to those who have not even completed a single leve for the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 34: I have received a full report of your efforts, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> and prepared your seals accordingly.
#. column 35: You do not appear to be affiliated with any of the Grand Companies of Eorzea. The leves I issue are only for those who have pledged to serve the realm.
#. column 36: I cannot issue company levequests to those who have not attained the rank of sergeant third class. I have my orders.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:25:0:30"
msgid "Storm Sergeant First Class C'lafumyn Quoh. I have been given authorization to issue Grand Company levequests."
msgstr "Сержант первого класса Водоворота К'Лафумин Кво. Мне поручено выдавать задания Великих компаний."

#. ja: 「ギルドリーヴ」の経験がある者がいれば、<br>この任務を任せることができるんだけど……。<br>軍令部に、兵を回すように上申しなくては。
