msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:25:0:33"
msgid "I will not issue Grand Company levequests to those who have not even completed a single leve for the Adventurers' Guild."
msgstr "Не стану выдавать поручения Великой компании тем, кто не выполнил ни одного гильдейского поручения."

#. ja: 任務達成を確認！<br><string $gs1><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>には、<br>規定に従い、軍票を支給します！
#. de: Hast du deinen Auftrag erfolgreich ausgeführt, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>? Hervorragend. Du bist ein Vorbild für alle, die im Dienst des Mahlstroms stehen.
#. fr: Bravo, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>, vous avez fait du bon trrravail<nbsp>! Voilà vos sceaux.
