#. column 35: I have no leves for you, civilian. Enlist yourself in a Grand Company─preferably the Order of the Twin Adder─and then speak with me again.
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:26:0:30"
msgid "My duty within the Order of the Twin Adder is to issue Grand Company levequests."
msgstr "Мой долг в Ордене Двух Змей — выдавать поручения Великой компании."

#. ja: 「ギルドリーヴ」の経験者がいれば、<br>この任務を任せることができるのですが……。<br>統合司令部に、増員を求めなくては。
