#. column 31: You shall not be issued a single company leve until you have proven you can handle one issued by the Adventurers' Guild.
#. column 32: The Matron ever watches, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: You shall not be issued a single company leve until you have proven you can handle one issued by the Adventurers' Guild.
