#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:26:0:35"
msgid "I have no leves for you, civilian. Enlist yourself in a Grand Company─preferably the Order of the Twin Adder─and then speak with me again."
msgstr "Для вас поручений нет, штатский. Вступите в одну из Великих компаний — лучше всего в Орден Двух Змей — и тогда поговорим."

#. ja: 小官は、双蛇党黄蛇隊に属す者。<br>「グランドカンパニーリーヴ」を管轄しています。
#. de: Guten Tag! Ich stehe im Dienst der Bruderschaft der Morgenviper, genauer gesagt der Gelben Schlangen, und vergebe in deren Auftrag Staatserlasse.
#. fr: Mon nom est H'amneko. Je suis chargée d'attribuer des mandats de grrrande compagnie pour l'ordre des Deux Vipères.
#. column 31: You must accept my apologies, but I must turn you away. You see, I cannot issue Grand Company leves to those who put themselves before the realm. Show your commitment to the aid of Eorzea's children by first accepting their tasks. The Adventurers' Guild will steer you true.
#. column 32: The Matron ever watches, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: You must accept my apologies, but I must turn you away. You see, I cannot issue Grand Company leves to those who put themselves before the realm. Show your commitment to the aid of Eorzea's children by first accepting their tasks. The Adventurers' Guild will steer you true.
#. column 34: Welcome back, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. I have readied your seals.
#. column 35: The Order of the Twin Adder has tasked me with the issuance of Grand Company levequests. They have also tasked me with turning away all those who have yet to enlist. Consider yourself turned away.
#. column 36: You must accept my apologies, but I must turn you away. You see, I cannot issue leves to those who have not proven their worth. Speak with me again upon attaining the rank of sergeant third class.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:27:0:30"
msgid "The Order of the Twin Adder has tasked me with the issuance of Grand Company levequests."
msgstr "Я поручена Орденом Двух Змей выдавать поручения Великой компании."

#. ja: 「ギルドリーヴ」の経験者がいれば、<br>この任務を任せることができるのですが……。<br>統合司令部に、増員を求めなくては。
