msgid "You must accept my apologies, but I must turn you away. You see, I cannot issue leves to those who have not proven their worth. Speak with me again upon attaining the rank of sergeant third class."
msgstr "Простите, но я вынуждена вам отказать. Не могу выдавать поручения тем, кто ещё не доказал свою состоятельность. Возвращайтесь, когда дослужитесь до сержанта третьего класса."

#. ja: 不滅隊のキキリ闘曹長であります！<br>「グランドカンパニーリーヴ」の任務を<br>発行しているのであります！
#. de: Ich bin Legionsgefreite 1. Klasse Kikiri und zuständig für die Vergabe von Staatserlassen.
#. fr: Mon nom est Kikiri. Je suis chargée de distribuer des mandats de grande compagnie pour les Immortels.
#. column 31: No company leves for you, I'm afraid. The Adventurers' Guild hasn't given you their official stamp of approval, and you won't find me questioning any one of the guildmasters' judgment.
#. column 32: May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: No company leves for you, I'm afraid. The Adventurers' Guild hasn't given you their official stamp of approval, and you won't find me questioning any one of the guildmasters' judgment.
#. column 34: Mission accomplished, eh? I have your seals ready right here, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 35: No company leves for you, my friend. The Immortal Flames are required by Allied decree to offer levequests to those belonging to lesser companies, namely the Maelstrom and the Order of the Twin...something or other, but nowhere does it state that we need to provide leves to common riffraff.
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:28:0:30"
msgid "The name is Kikiri Kiri, but you can call me Sergeant Kiri. It's my duty to issue company leves, and you tell them I do a right fine job of it, if anyone asks."
msgstr "Зовут меня Кикири Кири, но можете звать сержантом Кири. Я выдаю поручения Великой компании. Если кто спросит, скажите, что делаю я это на славу!"

#. ja: 「ギルドリーヴ」の経験がある者がいれば、<br>良いのでありますが……。<br>作戦本部に掛け合わねばなりません。
#. de: Für unerfahrene Soldaten habe ich keine Verwendung, aber wer schon mal einen Gilden<shy>frei<shy>brief absolviert hat, kann sich jederzeit bei mir zum Dienst melden.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolée, mais je ne suis pas autorisée à confier des missions aux aventuriers qui n'ont pas encore accompli un seul mandat de guilde.
#. column 30: The name is Kikiri Kiri, but you can call me Sergeant Kiri. It's my duty to issue company leves, and you tell them I do a right fine job of it, if anyone asks.
#. column 32: May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: No company leves for you, I'm afraid. The Adventurers' Guild hasn't given you their official stamp of approval, and you won't find me questioning any one of the guildmasters' judgment.
#. column 34: Mission accomplished, eh? I have your seals ready right here, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 35: No company leves for you, my friend. The Immortal Flames are required by Allied decree to offer levequests to those belonging to lesser companies, namely the Maelstrom and the Order of the Twin...something or other, but nowhere does it state that we need to provide leves to common riffraff.
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:28:0:31"
msgid "No company leves for you, I'm afraid. The Adventurers' Guild hasn't given you their official stamp of approval, and you won't find me questioning any one of the guildmasters' judgment."
msgstr "Боюсь, поручений Великой компании вам не получить. Гильдия искателей приключений ещё не дала вам своего официального одобрения, а я не стану ставить под сомнение решение её главы."

#. ja: <string $gs1><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>に<br>クリスタルの導きあれ！
#. de: Der Kristall zeigt dir den Weg, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <string $gs1>!
#. fr: Vous avez vos ordres, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>. Que le Cristal vous montre la voie<nbsp>!
