msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:28:0:35"
msgid "No company leves for you, my friend. The Immortal Flames are required by Allied decree to offer levequests to those belonging to lesser companies, namely the Maelstrom and the Order of the Twin...something or other, but nowhere does it state that we need to provide leves to common riffraff."
msgstr "Поручений Великой компании для вас нет, дружище. По указу Альянса Бессмертные должны выдавать задания членам младших компаний — Водоворота и Ордена Двух... как там его, — но нигде не сказано, что мы обязаны поручать что-то всякому сброду."

#. ja: 不滅隊のブルー・ヘリング闘曹長であります！<br>「グランドカンパニーリーヴ」の任務を<br>発行しているのであります！
#. de: Ich bin Blauer Hering, Legionsgefreite und zuständig für die Vergabe von Staatserlassen.
#. fr: Mon nom est Blue Herring. Je suis chargée de gérer des mandats de grande compagnie pour les Immortels.
#. column 31: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 32: May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 34: A job well done, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. Let me count out your seals.
#. column 35: Apologies, adventurer. I am only authorized to issue leves to those who have enlisted in a Grand Company. You have not, and here we stand.
#. column 36: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if he knew I'd issued a leve to someone who hadn't even earned the rank of sergeant third class.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:29:0:30"
msgid "Flame Sergeant First Class Blue Herring. I suppose you're here to be issued a Grand Company levequest."
msgstr "Сержант первого класса Бессмертного отряда, Блю Херринг. Полагаю, вы за поручением Великой компании."

