msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:29:0:32"
msgid "May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>."
msgstr "Да озарит вас свет Кристалла, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>."

#. ja: 「ギルドリーヴ」の経験がある者がいれば、<br>良いのでありますが……。<br>作戦本部に掛け合わねばなりません。
#. de: Für unerfahrene Soldaten habe ich keine Verwendung, aber wer schon mal einen Gilden<shy>frei<shy>brief absolviert hat, kann sich jederzeit bei mir zum Dienst melden.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolée, mais je ne suis pas autorisée à confier des missions aux aventuriers qui n'ont pas encore accompli un seul mandat de guilde.
#. column 30: Flame Sergeant First Class Blue Herring. I suppose you're here to be issued a Grand Company levequest.
#. column 31: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 32: May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 34: A job well done, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. Let me count out your seals.
#. column 35: Apologies, adventurer. I am only authorized to issue leves to those who have enlisted in a Grand Company. You have not, and here we stand.
#. column 36: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if he knew I'd issued a leve to someone who hadn't even earned the rank of sergeant third class.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:29:0:33"
msgid "The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks."
msgstr "Командир снимет с меня голову, если я позволю тому, кто не выполнил даже простейшего поручения Гильдии, взяться за одно из наших заданий."

#. ja: 任務達成を確認！<br>規定に従い、軍票を支給するのであります！
#. de: Ich gratuliere zum erfolgreichen Abschluss des Auftrags, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. Du hast dir deine Staatstaler redlich verdient.
#. fr: Mes félicitations, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>, vous avez fait du bon travail<nbsp>! Prenez vos sceaux de compagnie.
#. column 30: Flame Sergeant First Class Blue Herring. I suppose you're here to be issued a Grand Company levequest.
#. column 31: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 32: May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 35: Apologies, adventurer. I am only authorized to issue leves to those who have enlisted in a Grand Company. You have not, and here we stand.
#. column 36: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if he knew I'd issued a leve to someone who hadn't even earned the rank of sergeant third class.
#. column 37: 0
