msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:29:0:34"
msgid "A job well done, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>. Let me count out your seals."
msgstr "Отличная работа, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>. Сейчас отсчитаю вам печати."

#. ja: 不滅隊の「グランドカンパニーリーヴ」を、<br>発行しているのであります！　いずれかの組織に<br>所属してから、訪れてほしいのであります！
#. de: Erlasse können nur von Mitgliedern einer Staatlichen Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft ausgeführt werden. Kehre zurück, wenn du dich bei einer gemeldet hast.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolée, mais je ne suis pas autorisée à confier des missions aux aventuriers qui n'ont pas encore prêté allégeance à l'une des trois or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tions de l'Alliance éorzéenne.
#. column 30: Flame Sergeant First Class Blue Herring. I suppose you're here to be issued a Grand Company levequest.
#. column 31: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 32: May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 34: A job well done, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. Let me count out your seals.
#. column 36: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if he knew I'd issued a leve to someone who hadn't even earned the rank of sergeant third class.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:29:0:35"
msgid "Apologies, adventurer. I am only authorized to issue leves to those who have enlisted in a Grand Company. You have not, and here we stand."
msgstr "Простите, искатель приключений. Мне разрешено выдавать поручения только тем, кто вступил в одну из Великих компаний. Вы не вступили — вот и весь разговор."

#. ja: この任務を任せられる者がいれば、<br>良いのでありますが……。<br>「伍長」以上の者さえいれば、と思うのであります！
#. de: Für unerfahrene Soldaten habe ich keine Verwendung, aber wer mindestens den Rang eines  Legionsgefreiten 3. Klasse oder einen vergleichbaren Rang einer anderen Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft hat, kann sich jederzeit bei mir zum Dienst melden.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolée, mais je ne suis pas autorisée à confier des missions aux recrues qui n'ont pas au moins le grade d'adjudant. Demandez une promotion et revenez me voir<nbsp>!
#. column 30: Flame Sergeant First Class Blue Herring. I suppose you're here to be issued a Grand Company levequest.
#. column 31: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 32: May you walk in the light of the Crystal, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if I were to allow one who had yet to complete even the simplest of guild-issued levequests to undertake one of our tasks.
#. column 34: A job well done, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. Let me count out your seals.
#. column 35: Apologies, adventurer. I am only authorized to issue leves to those who have enlisted in a Grand Company. You have not, and here we stand.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:29:0:36"
msgid "The commanding officer would have my head on a pike if he knew I'd issued a leve to someone who hadn't even earned the rank of sergeant third class."
msgstr "Командир насадил бы меня на пику, узнай он, что я выдала поручение тому, кто даже до сержанта третьего класса не дослужился."

#. ja: 小官は、双蛇党黄蛇隊に属す者。<br>イシュガルドとの協定に基づき、ここ占星台にて、<br>「グランドカンパニーリーヴ」を発行しております。
#. de: Guten <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Abend<else>Morgen</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Tag<else>Abend</if></if>! Ich stehe im Dienst der Bruderschaft der Morgenviper, genauer gesagt der Gelben Schlangen und vergebe hier am Observatorium aufgrund des Abkommens mit Ishgard Staatserlasse.
#. fr: Mon nom est Haisie. Je suis chargée de gérer des mandats de grande compagnie pour l'ordre des Deux Vipères.
#. column 31: My records show you haven't even completed a <i>single</i> Adventurers' Guild-issued levequest. Are the Grand Companies so desperate for swords that they would allow such a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their ranks?
#. column 32: The Matron ever watches, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>...though most likely from someplace warmer.
#. column 33: I cannot issue you any company leves in your current condition. You wouldn't survive a quarter bell with the lot of them...if the cold didn't claim you first.
#. column 34: Ah, you've returned, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>...and yes, I still wait for the second watch, so it is from I who you will receive your seals.
#. column 35: Curse the Adders' Nest for insisting I wear Twin Adder colors in this rime-bound purgatory! My legs are frozen, my lips blue, and the second watch has yet to show. And now, some adventurer comes along wanting to chat. I am in no mood to chat. Look at these wind-burned thighs. Do I look like I'm in the mood to <i>chat</i>!
#. column 36: Not yet sergeant third class? Then I have nothing for you this day. This cold, cold day. This why-must-I-continue-to-stand-out-here-in-the-bloody-cold-while-the-second-watch-is-probably-off-by-a-warm-fire-squeezing-some-whore's-arse day...
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:30:0:30"
msgid "Curse the Adders' Nest for insisting I wear Twin Adder colors in this rime-bound purgatory! My legs are frozen, my lips blue, and the second watch has yet to show. If you are here for a leve, be quick about it. I know not how much more of this cold I can take!"
msgstr "Чтоб Гнездо Гадюк провалилось! Заставили меня надеть цвета Ордена Двух Змей в этом ледяном аду! Ноги замёрзли, губы посинели, а вторая смена всё не идёт. Если вы за поручением — говорите скорей. Не знаю, сколько ещё выдержу этот холод!"

#. ja: 小官が管轄している任務は、<br>いずれも厳しいものばかり……。<br>せめて「ギルドリーヴ」の経験者がいれば……。
#. de: Meine Anweisungen sind äußerst strikt. Wer noch keine Erfahrung mit Gilden<shy>frei<shy>briefen hat, braucht sich gar nicht bei mir zu melden.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolée, mais je ne suis pas autorisée à confier des missions aux aventuriers qui n'ont pas encore accompli un seul mandat de guilde.
#. column 30: Curse the Adders' Nest for insisting I wear Twin Adder colors in this rime-bound purgatory! My legs are frozen, my lips blue, and the second watch has yet to show. If you are here for a leve, be quick about it. I know not how much more of this cold I can take!
#. column 32: The Matron ever watches, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>...though most likely from someplace warmer.
#. column 33: I cannot issue you any company leves in your current condition. You wouldn't survive a quarter bell with the lot of them...if the cold didn't claim you first.
#. column 34: Ah, you've returned, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>...and yes, I still wait for the second watch, so it is from I who you will receive your seals.
#. column 35: Curse the Adders' Nest for insisting I wear Twin Adder colors in this rime-bound purgatory! My legs are frozen, my lips blue, and the second watch has yet to show. And now, some adventurer comes along wanting to chat. I am in no mood to chat. Look at these wind-burned thighs. Do I look like I'm in the mood to <i>chat</i>!
#. column 36: Not yet sergeant third class? Then I have nothing for you this day. This cold, cold day. This why-must-I-continue-to-stand-out-here-in-the-bloody-cold-while-the-second-watch-is-probably-off-by-a-warm-fire-squeezing-some-whore's-arse day...
#. column 37: 0
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:30:0:31"
msgid "My records show you haven't even completed a <i>single</i> Adventurers' Guild-issued levequest. Are the Grand Companies so desperate for swords that they would allow such a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their ranks?"
msgstr "В моих записях нет ни одного выполненного вами <i>гильдейского поручения</i>. Великие компании так отчаялись, что берут в свои ряды кого попало?"

#. ja: <string $gs1><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>に<br>ノフィカ様の祝福あらんことを！
#. de: Nophica stehe dir bei, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>!
#. fr: Vous avez vos ordres, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>. Que les Douze vous protègent<nbsp>!
#. column 30: Curse the Adders' Nest for insisting I wear Twin Adder colors in this rime-bound purgatory! My legs are frozen, my lips blue, and the second watch has yet to show. If you are here for a leve, be quick about it. I know not how much more of this cold I can take!
