msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:30:0:32"
msgid "The Matron ever watches, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>...though most likely from someplace warmer."
msgstr "Да хранит вас Матрона, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>... Хотя вы, похоже, прибыли из мест потеплее."

#. ja: 小官が管轄している任務は、<br>いずれも厳しいものばかり……。<br>相応の実力を持った将兵が必要なのです。
#. de: Meine Anweisungen sind äußerst strikt. Wenn deine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten nicht den Anforderungen entsprechen, brauchst du dich gar nicht bei mir zu melden.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolée, mais je ne suis pas autorisée à confier des missions aux aventuriers débutants. Vous allez devoir vous entraîner davantage<nbsp>!
#. column 30: Curse the Adders' Nest for insisting I wear Twin Adder colors in this rime-bound purgatory! My legs are frozen, my lips blue, and the second watch has yet to show. If you are here for a leve, be quick about it. I know not how much more of this cold I can take!
#. column 31: My records show you haven't even completed a <i>single</i> Adventurers' Guild-issued levequest. Are the Grand Companies so desperate for swords that they would allow such a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in their ranks?
#. column 32: The Matron ever watches, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>...though most likely from someplace warmer.
#. column 34: Ah, you've returned, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>...and yes, I still wait for the second watch, so it is from I who you will receive your seals.
#. column 35: Curse the Adders' Nest for insisting I wear Twin Adder colors in this rime-bound purgatory! My legs are frozen, my lips blue, and the second watch has yet to show. And now, some adventurer comes along wanting to chat. I am in no mood to chat. Look at these wind-burned thighs. Do I look like I'm in the mood to <i>chat</i>!
#. column 36: Not yet sergeant third class? Then I have nothing for you this day. This cold, cold day. This why-must-I-continue-to-stand-out-here-in-the-bloody-cold-while-the-second-watch-is-probably-off-by-a-warm-fire-squeezing-some-whore's-arse day...
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:30:0:33"
msgid "I cannot issue you any company leves in your current condition. You wouldn't survive a quarter bell with the lot of them...if the cold didn't claim you first."
msgstr "В нынешнем состоянии я не могу выдать вам поручение Великой компании. Вы и четверти колокола с ними не продержитесь... если холод раньше не прикончит."

#. ja: 任務達成を確認、現時刻を以て、<br><string $gs1><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>の任務を解きます。<br>お疲れ様でした、軍票の支給をお受けください。
#. de: Auftrag erfolgreich ausgeführt, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>? Gratulation! Die Staatstaler hast du dir redlich verdient!
#. fr: Mes félicitations, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if>, vous avez fait du bon travail<nbsp>! Prenez vos sceaux de compagnie.
