msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:31:0:35"
msgid "The Holy See of Ishgard has been generous enough to allow representatives from the Grand Companies of Eorzea to issue company levequests within their lands. As you have yet to pledge your allegiance to any city<hyphen>state, I am afraid I cannot be of service to you."
msgstr "Святой престол Ишгарда великодушно позволил представителям Великих компаний Эорзеи выдавать поручения на своей земле. Но вы не присягнули ни одному из городов-государств, так что помочь я вам, боюсь, не могу."

#. ja: ホワイトブリム一帯における任務は、<br>想像以上に厳しいものばかりです。<br>せめて「伍長」以上の実力者がいれば……。
#. de: Die Aufgaben, die ich zu vergeben habe, sind härter, als du dir vorstellen kannst. Wer nicht mindestens den Rang eines Dritten Schlangenjüngers oder eines Sturmmaats oder Legionsgefreiten 3. Klasse hat, braucht es gar nicht erst zu versuchen.
#. fr: Vous voulez que je vous propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Je suis désolée, mais je ne suis pas autorisée à confier des missions aux recrues qui n'ont pas au moins le grade d'adjudant. Demandez une promotion et revenez me voir<nbsp>!
#. column 30: The Holy See of Ishgard has been generous enough to allow representatives from the Grand Companies of Eorzea to issue company levequests within their lands.
#. column 31: You have yet to show your commitment to the realm in the form of even a single levequest, and therefore I shall not indulge in this fantasy you have of undertaking a Grand Company leve.
#. column 32: The Matron ever watches, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>.
#. column 33: Did you not see the beasts roaming the hills on your way to the Front, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>? How do you expect to complete any of the tasks I hold here when you look barely able to clip the fur of a snow pup!
#. column 34: The local levewatches took quite an interest in your performance today, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. They have personally requested you for some of the local leves.
#. column 35: The Holy See of Ishgard has been generous enough to allow representatives from the Grand Companies of Eorzea to issue company levequests within their lands. As you have yet to pledge your allegiance to any city<hyphen>state, I am afraid I cannot be of service to you.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:31:0:36"
msgid "If it is a company leve you came for, I must ask that you return once attaining the rank of sergeant third class."
msgstr "За поручением Великой компании? Тогда возвращайтесь, когда дослужитесь до сержанта третьего класса."

#. ja: 不滅隊所属エイドハート准闘士であります！<br>自分の任務は、このモードゥナ地方を任地とする<br>「グランドカンパニーリーヴ」の管理であります！
#. de: Ich bin Phönixgefreiter Eidhart und zuständig für die Vergabe von Staatserlassen.
#. fr: Mon nom est Eidhart. Je suis chargé de gérer les mandats de grande compagnie pour les Immortels.
#. column 31: I've no time for those who've never bothered to take up a levequest.
#. column 32: I expect you back in one piece, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>.
#. column 33: I've no time for those who've yet to butt horns with a hapalit.
#. column 34: You look no worse for the wear. Not enough challenge, was it?
#. column 35: I can respect a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who chooses to pledge <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> allegiance to none. But I cannot issue Grand Company leves to that <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if>.
#. column 36: I have no words for those not yet the rank of chief sergeant...except for <i>those</i> words.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:32:0:30"
msgid "Here for a company leve? You know the drill."
msgstr "За поручением Великой компании? Знаете, что делать."

#. ja: モードゥナ地方における任務は、<br>いずれも厳しいものばかりなのであります！<br>「ギルドリーヴ」の経験が必要なのであります！
#. de: Die Missionen hier sind hart. Wer keine Erfahrungen mit Gilden<shy>frei<shy>briefen hat, wird nicht in Betracht gezogen.
#. fr: Tu veux que je te propose des mandats de grande compagnie<nbsp>? Désolé, mais je peux pas confier des missions aux aventuriers qui ont pas encore accompli un seul mandat de guilde.
#. column 30: Here for a company leve? You know the drill.
#. column 32: I expect you back in one piece, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if>.
#. column 33: I've no time for those who've yet to butt horns with a hapalit.
#. column 34: You look no worse for the wear. Not enough challenge, was it?
#. column 35: I can respect a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who chooses to pledge <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> allegiance to none. But I cannot issue Grand Company leves to that <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if>.
#. column 36: I have no words for those not yet the rank of chief sergeant...except for <i>those</i> words.
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:32:0:31"
msgid "I've no time for those who've never bothered to take up a levequest."
msgstr "Мне некогда возиться с теми, кто ни разу не брался за поручение."

