#. ja: しっかり、仕事をこなしてくれたようだね！<br>さあ、報酬を受け取っておくれ！
#. de: Ich sehe, dass du dich reinhängst, und zwar mit guten Ergebnissen. Du hast dir deine Belohnung verdient.
#. fr: Fé<shy>li<shy>ci<shy>ta<shy>tions, <if $gn4>voyageuse<else>voyageur</if>, vous avez fait du très bon travail<nbsp>! Tenez, voici votre récompense<nbsp>!
#. column 30: The Mean's looking for a few good artisans to handle some of the work they can't. We'd be much obliged if you'd fill a leve or two.
#. column 31: You dabble in trades? Could've fooled me. Are you sure?
#. column 32: We're all looking forward to seeing what you bring us, friend!
#. column 33: You dabble in trades? Could've fooled me. Are you sure?
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:35:0:34"
msgid "Came through, as we knew you would. Here's your reward. Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "Ну вот, мы знали, что ты не подведёшь. Держи награду. Заглядывай ещё!"

#. ja: グリーナーズ・ギルドシップに依頼される仕事を、<br>会員登録している職人たちに、リーヴとして斡旋しているんだ。<br>お前さんも、ひとつどうだい？
#. de: Bist du zufällig auf der Suche nach Arbeit? Ich vergebe Aufträge von der Gilde der Klauber in Form von Freibriefen an angemeldete Helfer. Ein Paar tüchtige Hände mehr können wir gerade gut gebrauchen.
#. fr: Ce n'est pas le travail qui manque ici. Que diriez-vous de remplir un petit mandat pour le compte du collège des glaneurs<nbsp>?
#. column 31: Should you know a capable <if $gn4>tradeswoman<else>tradesman</if> in need of work, I beg you send them here.
#. column 32: I trust your work proceeds apace? The guildship looks forward to seeing the fruits of your labors.
#. column 33: Should you know a capable <if $gn4>tradeswoman<else>tradesman</if> in need of work, I beg you send them here.
#. column 34: Everything appears to be in order. Very well, here is your payment.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:36:0:30"
msgid "As ever, we are inundated with requests that beg for fulfillment. If you are come seeking work, we gladly welcome the assistance."
msgstr "Как всегда, работы невпроворот. Если пришёл искать заработок, будем рады твоей помощи."

#. ja: 仕事は増える一方だ。<br>新規に会員登録してくれる職人が見つかるといいんだが……。
#. de: Wir haben jede Menge zu tun. Leider reicht es zur Zeit hinten und vorne nicht an neuen Helfern ...
#. fr: Pfiouuu, ça en fait des commandes... Manque de chance, les artisans agréés ne se trouvent pas sous le pied d'un cheval.
#. column 30: As ever, we are inundated with requests that beg for fulfillment. If you are come seeking work, we gladly welcome the assistance.
#. column 32: I trust your work proceeds apace? The guildship looks forward to seeing the fruits of your labors.
#. column 33: Should you know a capable <if $gn4>tradeswoman<else>tradesman</if> in need of work, I beg you send them here.
#. column 34: Everything appears to be in order. Very well, here is your payment.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
#. macro: <if $gn4>tradeswoman<else>tradesman</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:36:0:31"
msgid "Should you know a capable <if $gn4>tradeswoman<else>tradesman</if> in need of work, I beg you send them here."
msgstr "Если знаешь умелого <if $gn4>мастера<else>мастера</if>, которому нужна работа, отправь его к нам, прошу."

#. ja: よお、依頼した仕事はどうだい？<br>終わったら報告してくれよ！
#. de: Sei gegrüßt! Hast du deinen Auftrag schon erledigt? Sag mir Bescheid, sobald du damit fertig bist.
#. fr: Alors, ça avance<nbsp>? Passez me voir dès que vous avez rempli votre mandat, et vous aurez droit à votre récompense.
#. column 30: As ever, we are inundated with requests that beg for fulfillment. If you are come seeking work, we gladly welcome the assistance.
#. column 31: Should you know a capable <if $gn4>tradeswoman<else>tradesman</if> in need of work, I beg you send them here.
#. column 33: Should you know a capable <if $gn4>tradeswoman<else>tradesman</if> in need of work, I beg you send them here.
#. column 34: Everything appears to be in order. Very well, here is your payment.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:36:0:32"
msgid "I trust your work proceeds apace? The guildship looks forward to seeing the fruits of your labors."
msgstr "Как там работа? Гильдия с нетерпением ждёт плодов твоих трудов."

#. ja: 仕事は増える一方だ。<br>新規に会員登録してくれる職人が見つかるといいんだが……。
#. de: Wir haben jede Menge zu tun. Leider reicht es hinten und vorne nicht an neuen Helfern ...
