#. ja: お仕事を無事に終えられたようですね！<br>それでは、それでは、こちらの報酬をお受け取りください！
#. de: Ihr konntet den Auftrag ohne Zwischenfälle erledigen, ja? Dann bitte, diese Belohnung habt Ihr Euch mehr als verdient!
#. fr: Hou<nbsp>! C'est un excellent travail<nbsp>! Acceptez cette compensation, en récompense de vos efforts<nbsp>!
#. column 30: Might you have time to undertake a few commissions? Our city is in constant need of talented artisans.
#. column 31: How are we ever to fulfill all of these requests? \<sigh> What we need is someone experienced in trades.
#. column 32: 0
#. column 33: How are we ever to fulfill all of these requests? \<sigh> What we need is someone experienced in trades.
#. column 35: 0
#. column 36: 0
#. column 37: 0
msgctxt "GuildleveAssignmentTalk:37:0:34"
msgid "You honor us greatly with your contribution. Please accept this as a token of our appreciation."
msgstr "Ты оказал нам огромную услугу. Прими это в знак нашей признательности."
